-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-lg text-ink tracking-tight\" href=\"/\">Mehran Dental<span class=\"text-teal\">.</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-ink/70\"><a class=\"hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"tel:03352411106\" class=\"hidden sm:inline text-sm font-semibold text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\">0335 2411106</a><a class=\"hidden sm:inline-block rounded-full bg-teal text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 hover:bg-teal-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Book a visit</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"md:hidden p-2 -mr-2 rounded-md text-ink/80 hover:bg-ink/5 active:bg-ink/10 transition\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"md:hidden overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-200 ease-in-out bg-white border-b border-line max-h-0\"><nav class=\"flex flex-col px-5 py-2\"><a class=\"py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink/80 border-b border-line last:border-b-0\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink/80 border-b border-line last:border-b-0\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink/80 border-b border-line last:border-b-0\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a href=\"tel:03352411106\" class=\"py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink/80 border-b border-line\">Call: 0335 2411106</a><a class=\"my-3 text-center rounded-full bg-teal text-white text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2.5 hover:bg-teal-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Book a visit</a></nav></div></header><section class=\"bg-mint py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 md:px-8 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-teal-dark\">About us</p><h1 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-4xl text-ink mt-2\">Neighborhood dentistry, done properly.</h1></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"relative rounded-tl-[3rem] rounded-br-[3rem] rounded-tr-2xl rounded-bl-2xl bg-sand p-8 md:p-12\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\" fill=\"none\" class=\"absolute -top-8 left-10 w-40 h-14 text-teal/30\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 20 C 150 180, 450 180, 600 20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed\">Mehran Dental Care is a local clinic in Latifabad, Hyderabad, offering general and cosmetic dental treatment — from routine cleanings and fillings to root canal treatment, dentures, and orthodontics — for patients of all ages.</p><p class=\"text-ink/80 leading-relaxed mt-4\">We keep two daily shifts so that patients with work or school schedules can still find a convenient time, and we handle appointment requests and questions directly over WhatsApp so getting in touch is simple.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-10\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink\">General dentistry</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2\">Checkups, cleanings, fillings, and everyday care.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink\">Restorative care</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2\">Crowns, dentures, root canal, and tooth replacement.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line p-6\"><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink\">Cosmetic treatment</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2\">Whitening and orthodontic treatment for your smile.</p></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-ink text-white mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8 py-14 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div><p class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-lg\">Mehran Dental<span class=\"text-teal\">.</span></p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed max-w-xs\">A neighborhood dental clinic in Latifabad, Hyderabad — general and cosmetic dentistry for the whole family.</p></div><div class=\"text-sm\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-white/90 mb-3\">Visit us</p><p class=\"text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Unit No. 10, Market Road, near Afzal Ground, Latifabad Unit 10, Hyderabad, 71000</p><p class=\"text-white/60 mt-2\">0335 2411106</p></div><div class=\"text-sm\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-white/90 mb-3\">Explore</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-white/60\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/portal/login\">Staff login</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-5\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-white/40\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Mehran Dental Care, Hyderabad.</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[93092,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ho69r9xg1nxv.js\\\"],\\\"PublicNav\\\"]\\nc:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/280b6p5tv856z.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HC[\\\"/\\\",\\\"\\\"]\\na:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":nu